CTIVE INGREDIENT.'}{'symbol': 'FBHS', 'date': '2021-07-07 08:00:00', 'title': 'HOUSE OF ROHL UNVEILS KEY INTERIOR DESIGN TRENDS FOR 2021 AND BEYOND', 'text': "IRVINE, CALIF., JULY 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE HOUSE OF ROHL® , A PORTFOLIO OF LUXURY PLUMBING BRANDS, TODAY ANNOUNCED NEW INSIGHTS HIGHLIGHTING THE 2021 TRENDS THAT ARE HERE TO STAY AND\xa0WHAT'S NEXT\xa0IN THE WORLD OF HOME RENOVATION AND KITCHEN AND BATH DESIGN."}{'symbol': 'FOXA', 'date': '2021-07-07 15:58:00', 'title': 'FOX CORPORATION HIRES BRIAN NICK AS CHIEF COMMUNICATIONS OFFICER & EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT', 'text': 'NEW YORK AND LOS ANGELES, JULY 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FOX CORPORATION (NASDAQ: FOXA, FOX) (THE "COMPANY" OR "FOX") TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY\'S NEW HEAD OF COMMUNICATIONS.\xa0 BRIAN NICK\xa0HAS BEEN NAMED EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF COMMUNICATIONS OFFICER.'}{'symbol': 'FOX', 'date': '2021-07-07 15:58:00', 'title': 'FOX CORPORATION HIRES BRIAN NICK AS CHIEF COMMUNICATIONS OFFICER & EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT', 'text': 'NEW YORK AND LOS ANGELES, JULY 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FOX CORPORATION (NASDAQ: FOXA, FOX) (THE "COMPANY" OR "FOX") TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY\'S NEW HEAD OF COMMUNICATIONS.\xa0 BRIAN NICK\xa0HAS BEEN NAMED EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF COMMUNICATIONS OFFICER.'}{'symbol': 'BEN', 'date': '2021-07-07 09:28:00', 'title': 'FRANKLIN TEMPLETON PARTNERS WITH VWISE TO DELIVER PERSONALIZED INVESTMENT SOLUTIONS TO DEFINED CONTRIBUTION PARTICIPANTS', 'text': 'SAN MATEO, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FRANKLIN TEMPLETON PARTNERS WITH VWISE TO DELIVER PERSONALIZED INVESTMENT SOLUTIONS TO DEFINED CONTRIBUTION PARTICIPANTS'}{'symbol': 'GM', 'date': '2021-07-07 16:05:00', 'title': 'ABC TECHNOLOGIES RECOGNIZED BY GENERAL MOTORS AS WINNER OF COVETED OVERDRIVE AWARD AND NAMED SUPPLIER OF THE YEAR WINNER IN 5 PRODUCT LINES', 'text': "TORONTO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ABC TECHNOLOGIES WAS RECOGNIZED AS A GM OVERDRIVE AWARD WINNER AS WELL AS A MULTI-CATEGORY SUPPLIER OF THE YEAR AWARD 